  "releaseNotes": "MimeKit 5.0 is a major release containing a number of breaking changes. See https://github.com/jstedfast/MimeKit/blob/master/ReleaseNotes.md for the complete list of changes and migration notes.\n\n* MimeKit is now a meta-package that references MimeKit.Core (MIME creation and parsing) and MimeKit.Cryptography (S/MIME, PGP/MIME, DKIM, ARC and DMARC). MimeKitLite has been retired; use MimeKit.Core instead.\n* Promoted the new MIME parser (formerly ExperimentalMimeParser) to MimeParser. The previous implementation is available as LegacyMimeParser.\n* CryptographyContext no longer registers a default S/MIME context. Applications must explicitly register the context they want. This makes MimeKit AOT-compatible.\n* Added DMARC validation, MIME compliance violation reporting, a redesigned TNEF API with TnefWriter, and the RtfToText and RtfToHtml text converters.\n* Numerous performance improvements and bug fixes.",
